  <h2 id="sales">Who pays for these skills, and how they judge you</h2>

  <p>
    Clients and teams pay for safe progress and honest guidance. They judge you by results, safety and communication.
  </p>
  <p>
    The first basic skill is planning and logging a safe session.
  </p>

  <h2 id="ai">AI and sports science and exercise careers: which tasks are under pressure</h2>

  <p>
    AI tools draft plans and summarise data. Routine plan drafting shrinks.
  </p>
  <p>
    Safety judgment, coaching presence and accountability hold value. A staged path helps: now, use AI to draft and check plans against reliable sources; later, own coaching decisions.
  </p>

